              "text": "Sundar Pichai, CEO, Alphabet and Google: Thanks, Michael. Obviously, people go through a lot of commercial journeys across many of our surfaces: Search, YouTube, Gemini App and so on. So I think as well as we support, through Cloud and Ads, our entire Retail partners as well.",
              "text_hash": "2af1e76ce81e71784913605e97dcd9639d89bb75d4e9f3bcf984cc52e115f531",
              "turn_id": "turn-029",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                668.041018,
                530.291019,
                711.232425
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000245-ba6f5b67",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 245,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 21,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Sundar Pichai, CEO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "The opportunity to improve the experience, I think, can be kind of a huge foundational uplift here. But it's important that we are approaching it, keeping in mind that our users, as well as merchants here and figuring out that value.",
              "text_hash": "ba6f5b67a580e7eb90e47bd9b9f978def862039856e11cc5bf32cc8023d36622",
              "turn_id": "turn-029",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                87.283203,
                521.589848,
                145.363285
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000246-0a1f711a",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 246,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Sundar Pichai, CEO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "Part of what's been good in designing the Universal Commerce Protocol is it makes it much easier for users to complete transactions. But at the same time, it allows merchants to help showcase the range of their offerings, if they want to make promotions, et cetera. So all of that is built into the protocol.",
              "text_hash": "0a1f711a7a4ef09647c306882a8aec9707a0e9118135bf9d3818289acd5621ce",
              "turn_id": "turn-029",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                161.740234,
                485.320311,
                190.037107
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000247-fdc8e2ef",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 247,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Sundar Pichai, CEO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "And I think you have to get that value prop for the ecosystem right to make the experience better.",
              "text_hash": "fdc8e2ef9476c857eca3e23c2ebd9f5f9cfd410108904e1b95a1bf135b5a527c",
              "turn_id": "turn-029",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                206.414058,
                531.392578,
                234.712888
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000248-3f8dfa97",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 248,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Sundar Pichai, CEO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "And so it's foundational. And more importantly, we are now implementing the protocols, and our Gemini models are making progress in those agentic capabilities.",
              "text_hash": "3f8dfa97c110b4c86e9d6c3108e414a752c97f8632143795573c01f187ea36aa",
              "turn_id": "turn-029",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                251.087888,
                534.29883,
                294.275387
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000249-1e94ec05",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 249,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Sundar Pichai, CEO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "So, I'm excited about a future where, as people are going through discovery, searching, finding new things, if they're interested in acting upon it, all of that is seamless; and so it overall creates an expansionary moment.",
              "text_hash": "1e94ec05d22f424dc5eb07a5a0974674286f3605614fe66e0ca7f563ed26b5d5",
              "turn_id": "turn-029",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                310.652348,
                530.54883,
                353.841802
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000250-1ca235d3",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 250,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Anat Ashkenazi, SVP and CFO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "Anat Ashkenazi, SVP and CFO, Alphabet and Google: And the question with regard to the CapEx and what makes up the total that we've announced for this year and last year.",
              "text_hash": "1ca235d36d61334c09f3664bee2989764a78a1b13d92ceeb4ca541e762432758",
              "turn_id": "turn-030",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                370.216798,
                530.953127,
                413.404297
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000251-aa72701f",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 251,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Anat Ashkenazi, SVP and CFO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "Approximately 60% of our investment in 2025, and it's going to be fairly similar in 2026, went towards machines; so, the servers. And then 40% is what you would refer to as long duration assets, which is our data centers and networking equipment.",
              "text_hash": "aa72701f8f0d5adf2ab1eb050632bc73bc390e17d738e9bbf3342828bce647f7",
              "turn_id": "turn-030",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                429.783208,
                534.972656,
                472.970707
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000252-30cd5423",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 252,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Anat Ashkenazi, SVP and CFO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "I think you're probably referring to the depreciation delta between them, those long-term duration assets depreciate over -- the building could be 40 years or longer. Other components may be less than that.",
              "text_hash": "30cd54231dfded450f7b69cb34f1a775c7434b5086659f4b8f4cadb66446fedf",
              "turn_id": "turn-030",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                489.347658,
                533.361328,
                532.535157
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000253-57d8268a",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 253,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Anat Ashkenazi, SVP and CFO, Alphabet and Google",
              "speaker_role": "management",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "Another important component is how we allocate this CapEx, and we've commented in the past about the allocation of our ML compute across the business. And for 2026, just over half of our ML compute is expected to go towards the Cloud business.",
              "text_hash": "57d8268a4f12844ffca3367588e6a9915d2b894459b84a980d429184f8de97d2",
              "turn_id": "turn-030",
              "type": "paragraph"
            },
            {
              "asset_id": null,
              "bbox": [
                69.75,
                548.912108,
                407.800779,
                562.318358
              ],
              "block_id": "block-000254-a2fe3ba4",
              "dom_path": null,
              "exchange_id": "qa-06",
              "layout_role": null,
              "ordinal": 254,
              "page_size": [
                612.0,
                792.0
              ],
              "pdf_page": 22,
              "reported_page": null,
              "section": "qa",
              "source_anchor": null,
              "speaker": "Michael Nathanson (MoffettNathanson)",
              "speaker_role": "analyst",
              "statement_status": "source_statement_not_verified_fact",
              "style_signature": {},
              "table": null,
              "text": "Michael Nathanson (MoffettNathanson): Thank you so much.",
              "text_hash": "a2fe3ba49371fd322a99c3daaa827844b80aa52c134a2d13bb3c55dadd38f991",
              "turn_id": "turn-031",
